@base_url = http://localhost:8080/api

### Delete Deck Tests

### Happy Path
DELETE {{base_url}}/deck/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: { "id": "1","email": "a@a.com"}

### Bad Path Deck doesn't exist
DELETE {{base_url}}/deck/999 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: { "id": "1","email": "a@a.com"}

### Remove card from a deck

DELETE {{base_url}}/deck/1/card/10 HTTP/1.1
authorization: {"id": "1", "email": "a@a.com"}

### Remove Card from Deck - Bad Path: Deck or Card Not Found (404 Not Found)
DELETE {{base_url}}/deck/999999/card/10 HTTP/1.1
authorization: {"id": "1", "email": "a@a.com"}

### Remove Card from Deck - Bad Path: Transaction/Server Error (400 Bad Request)
DELETE {{base_url}}/deck/1/card/10 HTTP/1.1
authorization: {"id": "1", "email": "a@a.com"}

### Remove Card from Deck - Bad Path: Missing authorization header (400 Bad Request)
DELETE {{base_url}}/deck/1/card/10 HTTP/1.1